@*
    The Content zone of an account's page. Modules place their shapes in it with AccountPageTabs.Location and register
    their section with AddPageSection("Account", ...); the shared PageSections shape lists the sections down the side.
    Section ids keep their "account-" prefix, so links to a section (#account-contacts) keep working.
*@
@await DisplayAsync(await New.PageSections(Zone: Model, Page: AccountPageTabs.PageName, DefaultSection: AccountPageTabs.Overview, KeyPrefix: "account-", PageId: "account-page"))
